# Prepares the built fixture prestige-geomancy-seed1-opt0822 for the checks that load it (bd inc-10v7f).
# The old fixture, a .sav, held this state: wizard mode on with Free Advancement and Show All Combat Rolls
# (it makes the engine print the "Damage:" line, src/Fight.cpp, where Grounded Stance writes its own term);
# the Bard raised to Bard 7 (G until the sheet reads it; a feat menu in the way takes the key as offered, as
# the old script did: the level-up feat menu moved, Great Fortitude -> Focus Spell, KNOWN_DIFFERENCES,
# bd inc-10v7f.1); the new skill ranks put in Craft.
# Ruling V7-1: a fixture holds only the created character, so the checks that need the state make it here.
@while "more --" SPACE
w
@while "Enter wizard mode" y
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN DOWN
SPACE   # Free Advancement: NO -> YES
DOWN*9
SPACE   # Show All Combat Rolls: NO -> YES
ESC

d                               # character sheet
@until "Class  Bard 7" G
@while "Learn Spells: Level" ESC

S
@expect "Unspent Skill Ranks"
@cursorto:mark "Craft" DOWN
RIGHT*10
ENTER y
@until "Things in View" ESC
